  "created": "2026-04-14T00:56:33.91Z",
  "description": "Add Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool endpoints to any UWP app. zRover exposes input injection, screenshot capture, coordinate validation, and app-defined action dispatch tools through a FullTrust companion MCP server, letting AI agents interact with your app's UI.\n\nNew in 0.8.0: Low-level pointer tools — pointer_down, pointer_move, pointer_up — for stateful multi-finger touch and pen gestures spanning multiple MCP calls. Supports mixed touch+pen sessions.\n\nNew in 0.5.0: App Action API — implement IActionableApp to expose your own app's operations as list_actions / dispatch_action MCP tools.\n\nMinimal integration: three lines in App.xaml.cs.",
  "id": "zRover.Uwp",
